segment.source:
::He gazes at it ponderously, then looks at you.::

No. No, I haven't.

::With growing discomfort, he continues after a brief pause.:: What is it?&lt;end&gt;

The last Lemurian...

::He puffs smoke high up, his gaze clinging to the stalactites above before dropping it down..::

Why me, kid?&lt;end&gt;

segment.target:
